    <briefdescription>
<para>Appends JSON text to a string that the caller owns. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The struct holds no state. Each function writes into the string that the caller passes. appendSeparator places each comma, so no caller places a comma. </para>
